homelab-monitor
===============

Source, documentation and licenses: https://github.com/badutis/homelab-monitor

Services (all on this box):
  nginx                      :80 (LAN only)  /grafana/ -> Grafana
  grafana-server             127.0.0.1:3000
  victoria-metrics           127.0.0.1:8428  data in /var/lib/victoria-metrics
  prometheus-node-exporter   127.0.0.1:9100
  nftables                   inbound SSH and HTTP from LAN_CIDR networks only

Configuration:
  /etc/homelab/homelab.env   settings (root only); copied from /boot/homelab.env
                             on first boot
  sudo homelabctl check      validate it
  sudo homelabctl apply      apply TARGET, LAN_CIDR, RETENTION, SCRAPE_INTERVAL
  /root/homelab-credentials.txt
                             generated Grafana admin password (if none was set)

Login: SSH with the key from homelab.env only; no passwords, no root login.
Without homelab.env: log in on the console as root (password 1234, Armbian
asks for a new one at once); SSH stays closed until a key is configured.
